melee range. The Sokoban rings may as well be
helpful to stabilise your character; levitation
to not erase non-permanent engravings, conflict
or regeneration for apparent reasons. Any ring
with a hard gemstone is good to prepare a semi-
permanent engraving to get back your gear from
the nymph (the engraving with stones requires a
couple turns, though).

